  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThis recipe is specialized for nighttime portrait photography using red lighting. It gives night portraits a cinematic look. Because reds are shifted to be more orange, skin tones captured under red lighting have a more natural orange-tinted red. The shadows are shifted toward green, making the reds stand out even more. Achieve the ideal look by manually adjusting the white balance toward much cooler colors prior to shooting. Try it when shooting night portraits under red lighting.\n",
